    "January 6, 2026 Senate of Virginia District 15 and House of Delegates District 77 Special Election",
    "December 9, 2025 Fairfax County Braddock District Special Election",
    "November 4, 2025 General and Special Elections",
    "The online historical data on this site is pulled from a variety of historical primary sources and compilations. As we look at documents further back in time, the record becomes less comprehensive and more prone to gaps. For this reason, we have created an inventory table to help visitors understand which contests are available as of today.",
